    {
      "id": "p0247-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "During the big, final battle, Asriel speaks with strong conviction and disgust for the main character. To replicate this in Japanese, the translator gave Asriel a disrespectful speech pattern which includes the use of the assertive personal pronoun ore.",
        "raw": "During the big, final battle, Asriel speaks with strong conviction and disgust\nfor the main character. To replicate this in Japanese, the translator gave\nAsriel a disrespectful speech pattern which includes the use of the assertive\npersonal pronoun ore.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09584008,
          0.08890714,
          0.67694471,
          0.15462143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09381193,
          0.08819286,
          0.70678889,
          0.15569286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在最后的大战中，Asriel 说话非常笃定，对主角满怀厌恶。为在日语中再现这种感觉，译者让他采用无礼的语气，包括使用强势的第一人称 ore（我）。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 69,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
