    {
      "id": "p0247-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Little by little, though, the player is able to chip away at Asriel's hatred. Eventually, Asriel begins to speak with hesitation and less confidence. This is then followed by strong regret and shame for his actions.",
        "raw": "Little by little, though, the player is able to chip away at Asriel's hatred.\nEventually, Asriel begins to speak with hesitation and less confidence. This is\nthen followed by strong regret and shame for his actions.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09864906,
          0.4637,
          0.68807923,
          0.51356429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09381193,
          0.46298571,
          0.70678889,
          0.51463571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          18,
          19,
          20
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "不过，玩家逐渐瓦解了 Asriel 的仇恨。他开始迟疑，不再那么自信，随后又对自己的行为深感懊悔和羞愧。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
